      "type": "function",
      "name": "transmit1",
      "filePath": "src/org/jnode/driver/net/lance/LanceDriver.java",
      "summary": "Transmits a region of a buffer with offset/size handling. Records the event_snd event, undocks a buffer from usableBufs (returning buf1 if none available), copies the payload into a freshly allocated buffer, and delegates the copy to abstractDeviceCore.transmit.",
      "tags": ["transmit", "send", "buffer-pool", "copy"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "Uses MultiThreadBufferList2/Buffer2 from jx.buffer.multithread."
